<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Komercni Banka H1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Czech Komercni Banka H1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June</p>
<p>					 (billion Czech crowns)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   1.639 vs 2.533</p>
<p>    Total assets		     456.155 vs 423.688</p>
<p>    Loans to clients		 252.419 vs 240.626</p>
<p>    Clients' deposits		288.862 vs 256.097</p>
<p>Reserves for bad debt</p>
<p>    and general risk		  27.2   vs  29.6</p>
<p>    Capital adequacy	     10.33 pct vs 10.73 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Czech commercial bank is Komercni Banka a.s. Figures are to International Accounting Standards. Bank said its first half net to Czech Accounting Standards fell to 1.651 billion crowns from 2.57 billion.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
